WEBVTT

00:07.113 --> 00:10.759
Legend has it that there was a clan of hermits

00:10.783 --> 00:12.813
called Qian Clan.

00:14.513 --> 00:16.919
Their disciples were so smart that they could

00:16.943 --> 00:19.229
do anything from stabilizing the country

00:19.253 --> 00:22.069
to protecting the people.

00:22.093 --> 00:24.049
But things always turn around when they go too far.

00:24.073 --> 00:26.999
The Qian Clan eventually enraged the emperor

00:27.023 --> 00:29.823
for disturbing the social order.

00:30.183 --> 00:32.079
One sect upheld martial arts and vowed to

00:32.103 --> 00:34.313
fight against the court to the end.

00:34.373 --> 00:36.233
It was named Lingyuan.

00:36.483 --> 00:38.833
The other sect went into business

00:38.873 --> 00:40.519
and stayed away from the court.

00:40.543 --> 00:42.389
It was named Yuntai.

00:42.413 --> 00:46.189
Yuntai and Lingyuan were of the same origin.

00:42.773 --> 00:43.329
[Yuntai]

00:43.353 --> 00:44.423
[Lingyuan]

00:46.003 --> 00:52.763
[Yuntai Lingyuan]

00:46.213 --> 00:50.073
They fought for the following hundred years.

01:20.643 --> 01:21.753
Sir.

01:22.223 --> 01:24.663
We just wanted to plunder the passers-by.

01:26.253 --> 01:28.553
Tell your men to take away the weapons.

01:28.813 --> 01:31.153
[Yun Xiang, Yuntai Sect]

01:29.323 --> 01:32.043
We just want money, not your lives.

01:34.153 --> 01:35.853
The pirates cause trouble all year round.

01:36.163 --> 01:37.473
But they are

01:37.503 --> 01:39.773
not all foreigners.

01:39.843 --> 01:41.039
What do you mean?

01:41.063 --> 01:43.513
First, the court banned sea activities.

01:44.093 --> 01:46.183
Many fishermen lost their livelihoods,

01:46.422 --> 01:48.993
so, they gathered together to rob people.

01:49.233 --> 01:52.233
Second, many soldiers

01:52.403 --> 01:53.933
pretended to be pirates

01:54.733 --> 01:56.363
and stole the money in their own trust.

01:57.453 --> 02:00.743
Just like you two.

02:02.213 --> 02:03.213
I...

02:09.853 --> 02:12.503
How did you know who we are?

02:13.253 --> 02:14.643
You've made such a big scene.

02:15.233 --> 02:16.383
There are dozens of people,

02:16.523 --> 02:18.843
all holding the official swords.

02:18.013 --> 02:21.583
[Official sword]

02:23.363 --> 02:24.763
Be careful next time.

02:25.803 --> 02:28.133
Even swords are not the key.

02:28.303 --> 02:29.303
It's the official boots.

02:28.623 --> 02:30.783
[Official boots]

02:33.143 --> 02:34.463
We can't keep him alive anymore.

02:34.743 --> 02:36.353
Tell our men to do it.

02:54.933 --> 02:58.183
Haven't you thought if you see through us,

02:58.223 --> 03:00.069
you're bound to be dead?

03:00.093 --> 03:02.993
On the salt farm in Baiju Town, officials collude with the bandits.

03:03.433 --> 03:06.243
They expel the other outlaws and rob and kill the salt merchants.

03:07.583 --> 03:09.043
I'm afraid you two

03:09.213 --> 03:11.383
never intended to let me live.

03:11.423 --> 03:12.753
To be honest,

03:12.963 --> 03:17.169
we never left anyone alive.

03:17.193 --> 03:18.129
Something is wrong.

03:18.153 --> 03:19.039
Something is wrong?

03:19.063 --> 03:20.599
When a man is dying,

03:20.623 --> 03:23.103
normally, he would've wet his pants by now.

03:23.783 --> 03:26.473
But look, his hands are not even trembling.

03:28.633 --> 03:30.349
Who on earth are you?

03:30.373 --> 03:33.303
Those who know my identity couldn't live.

03:33.773 --> 03:35.213
But I haven't decided

03:35.663 --> 03:37.103
whether to kill you.

03:40.253 --> 03:42.743
Close the cage.

03:54.053 --> 03:55.053
Go out and check.

03:59.553 --> 04:00.819
You poisoned us?

04:00.843 --> 04:03.553
Not me. It was this.

04:08.223 --> 04:09.903
Outside are all my people.

04:10.153 --> 04:11.889
You can't escape

04:11.913 --> 04:13.123
even if you had wings.

04:32.123 --> 04:33.973
As long as you take the antidote,

04:34.213 --> 04:36.143
you won't die.

05:05.943 --> 05:06.983
There's more over here.

05:07.633 --> 05:08.873
Yun Xiang.

05:09.403 --> 05:11.643
Thank you for dealing with these scumbags for us.

05:12.623 --> 05:14.553
All I did was talk.

05:15.053 --> 05:16.289
You may look weak,

05:16.313 --> 05:17.849
but you united

05:17.873 --> 05:19.739
so many groups of people all by yourself.

05:19.763 --> 05:21.319
I really admire you.

05:21.343 --> 05:23.283
Thank you for your help.

05:23.773 --> 05:24.809
Now most of the official bandits

05:24.833 --> 05:26.723
have been wiped out.

05:26.943 --> 05:27.943
Next,

05:28.213 --> 05:30.383
I want to meet the mastermind behind it.

05:30.743 --> 05:31.559
What?

05:31.583 --> 05:32.953
Are you going to deal with Yan Luowang?

05:33.533 --> 05:35.383
He's a real wolf.

05:35.863 --> 05:37.992
Shall we go with you?

05:39.913 --> 05:42.413
Thank you for your kindness.

05:42.453 --> 05:46.049
I'll take full responsibility for my personal matter.

05:46.073 --> 05:47.219
How can you

05:47.243 --> 05:48.679
deal with him alone?

05:48.703 --> 05:49.703
Humans don't

05:49.983 --> 05:51.823
have claws and teeth of tigers or wolves,

05:51.943 --> 05:53.633
nor the power of lions or elephants,

05:53.823 --> 05:55.473
but they can catch the wolves, subdue the tigers,

05:55.563 --> 05:56.893
tame the lions, and hunt the elephants.

05:58.383 --> 05:59.393
How?

05:59.843 --> 06:00.843
Only...

06:02.233 --> 06:03.383
by our wisdom.

07:27.633 --> 07:32.163
[The Ingenious One]

07:32.643 --> 07:35.429
[Episode 1: The Young Master Came Down the Mountain.]

07:35.453 --> 07:38.683
[A month ago]

07:38.803 --> 07:40.863
[Yuntai]

07:41.163 --> 07:43.893
[Yuntai Mountain]

07:55.733 --> 07:58.179
Goodbye, Seniors. I'm leaving.

07:58.203 --> 07:59.089
Yun Xiang.

07:59.113 --> 08:01.719
You've been cultivating for 15 years. Now that you're leaving,

08:01.743 --> 08:03.439
when are you planning to come back?

08:03.463 --> 08:04.569
I don't know yet.

08:04.593 --> 08:05.909
It's fine if you don't know that.

08:05.933 --> 08:07.099
But remember,

08:07.123 --> 08:08.149
disciples of Yuntai

08:08.173 --> 08:10.279
enter the secular world and go after fame

08:10.303 --> 08:12.433
for the people in the world.

08:13.083 --> 08:14.283
Yuntai's principles are that

08:14.513 --> 08:15.709
we should care about the world

08:15.733 --> 08:16.953
and help the people.

08:18.453 --> 08:21.133
But the people of Yuntai also belong to the world.

08:22.603 --> 08:24.503
Once I settle the past deeds,

08:24.833 --> 08:26.683
I will surely follow the way of Yuntai.

08:36.853 --> 08:38.309
The rich merchant in Nandu, Wen Cong,

08:38.333 --> 08:41.009
bullied fellow merchants and dominated and disrupted the market.

08:41.033 --> 08:42.879
Now the evidence is solid.

08:42.903 --> 08:44.359
His property will be confiscated,

08:44.383 --> 08:47.383
and he'll immediately be sent to the salt farm in Baiju Town to do corvee labor.

08:46.583 --> 08:49.153
[Baiju Town]

08:58.713 --> 09:00.699
Yan Luowang uses his official position for personal gain.

09:00.723 --> 09:03.099
He pretends to be a bandit to rob the passing salt merchants,

09:03.123 --> 09:06.213
and killed many of my brothers in the name of suppressing bandits.

09:05.133 --> 09:07.253
[Hongyun Casino]

09:06.803 --> 09:08.413
Place your bets.

09:28.273 --> 09:29.843
On the fourth day of last month,

09:30.233 --> 09:32.023
a prisoner was brought here.

09:32.403 --> 09:33.819
He's over 60 years old.

09:33.843 --> 09:34.899
Do you remember him?

09:34.923 --> 09:36.113
What's his name?

09:36.543 --> 09:37.543
Wen Cong.

09:37.873 --> 09:39.603
You mean that cripple?

09:41.893 --> 09:42.893
Cripple?

09:44.403 --> 09:45.389
Where is he locked up?

09:45.413 --> 09:47.699
The prison on the salt farm.

09:47.723 --> 09:49.169
Who sent him here?

09:49.193 --> 09:50.373
Yan Luowang.

09:49.953 --> 09:52.833
[Yan Luowang, Mining Supervisor of the salt farm in Baiju Town]

09:51.873 --> 09:53.119
If you keep shaking it,

09:53.143 --> 09:55.273
the dice will be shattered by you.

09:59.443 --> 10:00.623
Two, three, four.

10:04.533 --> 10:06.223
Three fives. Leopard.

10:06.393 --> 10:07.393
Get lost!

10:09.203 --> 10:11.533
Who else dares to come up?

10:11.693 --> 10:12.763
Me.

10:24.313 --> 10:28.403
[Shu Yanan]

10:28.783 --> 10:30.643
You've already won 12 times in a row.

10:30.673 --> 10:32.293
Do you dare to make a big bet with me?

10:33.763 --> 10:35.609
Do you know who I am?

10:35.633 --> 10:37.689
The mining supervisor of the salt farm in Baiju Town,

10:37.713 --> 10:39.379
Yan Luowang, Lord Yan.

10:39.403 --> 10:40.983
You are knowledgeable.

10:41.463 --> 10:42.593
Girl,

10:43.343 --> 10:45.783
you shouldn't be here.

10:46.003 --> 10:48.843
You might lose yourself.

11:00.373 --> 11:01.803
This is my stake.

11:03.493 --> 11:05.613
That is a valuable item.

11:05.713 --> 11:06.393
It's not common stuff.

11:06.393 --> 11:07.193
I have a friend

11:07.193 --> 11:09.259
locked up in the prison of the salt farm.

11:09.283 --> 11:10.713
If I win,

11:10.823 --> 11:13.159
Lord Yan, please release him.

11:13.183 --> 11:15.079
Releasing a prisoner without permission

11:15.103 --> 11:17.883
is a crime of capital punishment.

11:19.113 --> 11:23.183
Everyone knows that you are in charge

11:23.223 --> 11:25.023
of everything in Baiju Town.

11:25.573 --> 11:26.573
No.

11:26.713 --> 11:30.983
I've always been fair and just.

11:35.303 --> 11:36.413
Releasing him

11:36.533 --> 11:37.743
is out of the question.

11:37.843 --> 11:40.133
But I can let you meet him.

11:40.193 --> 11:41.213
What do you think?

11:41.593 --> 11:43.443
Think carefully.

11:43.473 --> 11:44.473
This...

11:44.733 --> 11:47.673
is already a great favor from me.

11:48.973 --> 11:49.779
Deal.

11:49.803 --> 11:50.803
OK.

11:51.803 --> 11:52.953
You go first.

12:44.413 --> 12:45.503
How is it?

12:46.273 --> 12:49.243
We can play again if you don't like it.

12:49.693 --> 12:50.813
You cheated!

12:52.543 --> 12:54.383
I already told you.

12:54.663 --> 12:57.193
Don't get yourself involved.

13:23.263 --> 13:24.959
Not bad.

13:24.983 --> 13:25.629
Catch her!

13:25.653 --> 13:26.653
Yes.

13:46.693 --> 13:47.753
Get her!

13:50.633 --> 13:51.633
Move over!

13:51.793 --> 13:53.333
Hurry! Go after her!

14:04.343 --> 14:05.353
Stop!

14:06.013 --> 14:07.063
Stop!

14:09.423 --> 14:10.423
Stop!

14:11.703 --> 14:12.703
Stop!

14:16.253 --> 14:17.253
Stop!

14:29.753 --> 14:30.753
Go after her!

16:04.673 --> 16:07.543
[Chai’s Pharmacy]

16:16.813 --> 16:17.933
Dr Chai.

16:18.223 --> 16:21.383
Can I pay for the medicine a few days later?

16:21.663 --> 16:23.833
[Dr. Chai, Yuntai Sect]

16:21.803 --> 16:23.933
100 pence. No credit.

16:24.333 --> 16:25.333
It's on me.

16:25.413 --> 16:26.703
Take the medicine and leave.

16:27.463 --> 16:29.823
Thank you, sir. Thank you.

16:32.873 --> 16:33.873
Doctor,

16:34.303 --> 16:36.423
I'd like to ask for a folk prescription for heatstroke.

16:36.883 --> 16:38.363
It is still early spring,

16:38.453 --> 16:40.583
and you're asking for a prescription for heatstroke?

16:42.123 --> 16:43.413
An extra king will make the country a mess;

16:44.043 --> 16:45.273
while spare stuff makes us prepared.

16:45.913 --> 16:48.593
I'll feel more secure keeping some medicine at hand.

16:50.623 --> 16:51.623
You're lucky.

16:51.663 --> 16:53.353
I happen to have this medicine ready at hand.

16:53.533 --> 16:54.833
Please come with me.

17:03.033 --> 17:04.739
I haven't had guests for a long time. It's a bit shabby here.

17:04.763 --> 17:05.649
Please.

17:05.673 --> 17:06.673
It's okay.

17:08.333 --> 17:10.063
You've been based in Baiju Town

17:10.202 --> 17:11.733
for more than ten years, right?

17:12.283 --> 17:15.909
I was wondering what brought you here.

17:15.933 --> 17:19.213
Have you heard of a fellow disciple

17:19.242 --> 17:21.353
imprisoned on the salt farm in Baiju Town?

17:22.143 --> 17:23.143
Who?

17:23.313 --> 17:25.343
Senior Wen who's in charge of Nandu.

17:25.523 --> 17:26.523
Wen Cong?

17:33.243 --> 17:34.413
I was negligent.

17:34.863 --> 17:36.153
I didn't know about it.

17:36.843 --> 17:38.909
You never see any prisoners out

17:38.933 --> 17:40.663
of the dark prison on the salt farm.

17:41.013 --> 17:44.509
Besides, it's said that the mining supervisor is extremely violent.

17:44.533 --> 17:46.963
The title of the King of Hell is not unfounded.

17:47.063 --> 17:48.363
King of Hell?

17:49.143 --> 17:50.833
He's just a fool and a reckless man.

17:52.283 --> 17:53.439
You can't say that.

17:53.463 --> 17:55.253
They have a batch of soldiers.

17:55.273 --> 17:56.733
I've killed most of them.

17:59.883 --> 18:03.009
Then what did you

18:03.033 --> 18:04.643
look for Wen for?

18:05.213 --> 18:06.213
Nothing else.

18:14.903 --> 18:16.503
I just want to ask you

18:17.633 --> 18:18.923
if there are other disciples of our clan

18:19.263 --> 18:20.873
in Baiju Town?

18:21.333 --> 18:22.419
I've been alone here

18:22.443 --> 18:24.343
for over ten years.

18:29.103 --> 18:30.273
Hurry up.

18:32.343 --> 18:33.633
Don't slack off.

18:42.793 --> 18:44.489
Hurry up.

18:44.513 --> 18:45.079
Coming.

18:45.103 --> 18:46.103
Hurry up.

18:47.583 --> 18:50.173
[Yan Mansion]

18:48.073 --> 18:49.373
Load the wagon quickly.

18:55.193 --> 18:59.703
[Yan Mansion]

18:55.983 --> 18:57.983
Keep looking for her today.

18:58.513 --> 19:00.403
Even if that girl is a ghost,

19:00.763 --> 19:04.149
I don't believe she can disappear.

19:04.173 --> 19:04.989
Yes.

19:05.013 --> 19:06.139
I will keep an eye out.

19:06.163 --> 19:07.163
My lord.

19:14.223 --> 19:15.223
Who is it?

19:25.583 --> 19:27.229
Yan Luowang colluded with the Water Gang

19:27.253 --> 19:28.813
to kidnap and rob the salt merchants.

19:29.543 --> 19:30.753
The government didn't even

19:31.143 --> 19:32.489
notice such a big incident.

19:32.513 --> 19:35.453
His official account book was meticulous.

19:35.573 --> 19:38.653
That means there must be another secret account.

19:39.243 --> 19:40.639
I guess the secret account

19:40.663 --> 19:42.473
is hidden in Yan Luowang's house.

19:49.663 --> 19:50.639
Step aside.

19:50.663 --> 19:51.919
Don't you know whose carriage this is?

19:51.943 --> 19:52.389
Get down.

19:52.413 --> 19:54.023
Do you know who's in the carriage?

19:55.633 --> 19:58.003
[Ding Yi, Water Gang]

20:00.473 --> 20:03.843
It's only been a few days. Why are you here again?

20:04.053 --> 20:05.449
It's not peaceful lately.

20:05.473 --> 20:07.793
Master asked me to help you.

20:11.433 --> 20:12.799
Master asked me to remind you

20:12.823 --> 20:15.553
the government's been stricter and stricter on checking illegal salt.

20:16.363 --> 20:18.023
Don't act rashly.

20:18.703 --> 20:21.703
You want to make money and be safe.

20:21.933 --> 20:24.653
Is there such a good thing in the world?

20:32.533 --> 20:33.533
Open the door!

20:36.843 --> 20:38.133
Where did he go?

20:49.503 --> 20:50.329
Yan Luowang is back.

20:50.353 --> 20:51.353
Let's go.

20:51.963 --> 20:53.143
Did you follow me?

20:53.543 --> 20:55.273
Cut the crap and follow me.

20:55.403 --> 20:57.463
I can't leave before I finish my task.

21:22.613 --> 21:23.613
Come on.

21:59.733 --> 22:00.983
Hurry up.

22:10.583 --> 22:11.853
Have a seat, Mr. Ding.

22:23.143 --> 22:25.473
Is there anything wrong with the salt farm lately?

22:25.763 --> 22:26.933
No.

22:26.983 --> 22:28.923
Show me the secret account.

22:40.673 --> 22:43.649
Your accounts are getting fewer every month.

22:43.673 --> 22:47.549
The salt merchants are also getting shrewder.

22:47.573 --> 22:51.113
They often move in scores or hundreds.

22:51.313 --> 22:52.679
Even if we want to rob them,

22:52.703 --> 22:53.769
how can we do it?

22:53.793 --> 22:55.523
You slaughtered the caravan at will.

22:55.563 --> 22:57.013
You've gone too far.

22:57.243 --> 22:58.353
How can salt merchants not unite?

22:58.353 --> 23:00.009
Blood is on my hands,

23:00.033 --> 23:02.303
while you, Master Qi, live a relaxing life.

23:02.333 --> 23:03.783
Watch your mouth.

23:03.963 --> 23:05.663
If it weren't for the Water Gang,

23:06.163 --> 23:09.373
Lord Yan wouldn't be able to be so carefree.

23:17.543 --> 23:18.613
Where is the official account?

23:28.733 --> 23:30.213
I'll put away the secret account.

23:31.703 --> 23:32.993
Do keep it safe.

23:34.043 --> 23:36.083
This is for you to check.

23:37.303 --> 23:39.703
Okay, I'll take my leave.

23:40.153 --> 23:41.323
Let me see you off.

23:49.743 --> 23:50.899
Since you brought me here,

23:50.923 --> 23:52.293
just say what you want.

23:52.393 --> 23:53.963
What are you looking at?

23:54.153 --> 23:55.853
You've been following me.

23:55.963 --> 23:57.553
Shouldn't I ask you first?

23:58.533 --> 24:00.163
If it weren't for me,

24:00.693 --> 24:02.673
you would have been killed by Yan Luowang.

24:05.353 --> 24:07.033
Look at the sunset.

24:07.333 --> 24:08.873
What some people see is

24:09.063 --> 24:10.689
"The sunset and the lone duck fly together,

24:10.713 --> 24:12.523
and the autumn water reflects the same color as the sky."

24:13.863 --> 24:17.203
But what some other people see is the setting sun with the color of blood.

24:21.433 --> 24:24.093
Who is your friend in the dark prison?

24:29.443 --> 24:31.533
I was so close to you on the beam.

24:31.983 --> 24:33.553
I smelled the perfume of

24:33.593 --> 24:35.723
plum blossom in your sachet.

24:35.793 --> 24:37.113
After so many years,

24:37.313 --> 24:39.093
Mr. Wen still likes this kind of perfume.

24:39.913 --> 24:41.363
You know my godfather?

24:42.793 --> 24:44.343
Are you also from Yuntai?

24:45.003 --> 24:47.333
Yes, or no.

24:47.863 --> 24:49.243
Are you or are you not?

24:52.473 --> 24:54.053
He saved my life.

24:54.953 --> 24:57.753
I heard he's become a cripple in prison.

24:58.383 --> 25:00.433
It's not easy to save him.

25:01.673 --> 25:02.673
But Miss,

25:03.073 --> 25:04.923
if you cooperate with me,

25:05.033 --> 25:06.703
I can be 100% sure.

25:09.383 --> 25:12.593
What? You don't trust me?

25:12.863 --> 25:14.413
Or do you have a better choice?

25:15.963 --> 25:17.803
You don't know any martial arts.

25:18.083 --> 25:19.359
How can you join hands with me?

25:19.383 --> 25:20.963
As long as I'm smart, it's enough.

25:22.573 --> 25:24.773
If you go down this post road for 20 miles,

25:25.033 --> 25:26.383
there is a dock.

25:26.713 --> 25:28.043
Beside the dock are buried

25:28.153 --> 25:30.183
the official bandits under Yan Luowang.

25:30.913 --> 25:33.833
I killed them all.

25:35.553 --> 25:36.873
You're boasting.

25:37.823 --> 25:39.863
You just used others to kill them.

25:40.063 --> 25:42.553
I witnessed the battle at the riverside.

25:43.113 --> 25:45.963
If I wasn't sure that you and Yan Luowang were rivals,

25:46.153 --> 25:47.733
why would I have helped you?

25:50.083 --> 25:51.503
I see.

25:54.233 --> 25:56.273
You risked your life to steal the secret account.

25:56.503 --> 25:57.873
What's the use of it?

26:00.213 --> 26:01.463
If you trust me,

26:03.553 --> 26:05.043
do as I say.

26:10.863 --> 26:12.123
My name is Shu Yanan.

26:12.243 --> 26:13.423
Tell me your name too.

26:13.593 --> 26:14.593
Yun Xiang.

26:24.403 --> 26:25.693
Take the account

26:26.223 --> 26:27.139
to Yangzhou.

26:27.163 --> 26:29.019
Do everything according to our plan.

26:29.043 --> 26:30.133
What about you?

26:30.363 --> 26:31.733
I'm going to meet Wen Cong.

26:47.013 --> 26:48.833
Sir, please come in.

26:50.453 --> 26:52.523
[Hongyun Casino]

26:55.553 --> 26:58.193
Lord Yan is having bad luck tonight.

26:59.043 --> 27:00.153
Boy,

27:00.633 --> 27:03.603
why do your dots always outnumber mine by one?

27:04.073 --> 27:05.643
One more is enough to win.

27:08.873 --> 27:12.703
You were here last night, right?

27:15.443 --> 27:17.279
You have a good memory, Lord Yan.

27:17.303 --> 27:19.293
But I haven't seen you before.

27:19.973 --> 27:22.563
Are you a spy sent by the pirates?

27:23.523 --> 27:25.933
Why? Do I look like a pirate?

27:28.503 --> 27:29.689
Pretty boy,

27:29.713 --> 27:32.649
how about we change the rule of the game?

27:32.673 --> 27:34.289
How do you want to bet?

27:34.313 --> 27:36.163
Let's bet who has a smaller number of dots,

27:36.953 --> 27:39.213
on all the money you have.

27:41.563 --> 27:42.773
Such a big stake!

27:44.253 --> 27:45.253
My lord,

27:45.313 --> 27:46.329
I don't have that much money.

27:46.353 --> 27:47.363
It doesn't matter.

27:48.303 --> 27:49.669
As long as you win,

27:49.693 --> 27:52.489
you can take this ingot of gold.

27:52.513 --> 27:53.883
But I have a condition.

27:54.623 --> 27:56.213
I'll go first.

27:58.503 --> 27:59.523
What do you think?

28:01.033 --> 28:02.033
Okay.

28:02.513 --> 28:04.049
Are you sure?

28:04.073 --> 28:07.153
If we're even, the one who goes first wins.

28:08.923 --> 28:09.739
Okay.

28:09.763 --> 28:10.893
You have some guts.

28:34.953 --> 28:36.273
Three. That is the smallest.

28:36.293 --> 28:37.499
There's no smaller number.

28:37.523 --> 28:38.569
He's lost for sure.

28:38.593 --> 28:39.593
Wait!

28:40.253 --> 28:41.253
My lord,

28:41.373 --> 28:42.999
you're not leaving room for me.

28:43.023 --> 28:44.383
Cut the crap.

28:44.563 --> 28:45.519
Take the money.

28:45.543 --> 28:46.159
Yes.

28:46.183 --> 28:47.233
Wait.

28:48.203 --> 28:49.393
I haven't shaken the dice yet.

28:50.723 --> 28:51.723
Shake then.

28:52.433 --> 28:53.833
I want to see

28:54.873 --> 28:56.873
what you will get.

28:56.913 --> 28:57.799
Right?

28:57.823 --> 28:59.483
Yes.

29:20.503 --> 29:22.533
You're playing tricks.

29:33.463 --> 29:34.583
I'm done.

29:37.163 --> 29:38.533
Really?

29:44.813 --> 29:46.443
How is that possible?

29:59.393 --> 30:01.603
Lord Yan, I won.

30:02.273 --> 30:03.333
Wait.

30:04.713 --> 30:06.003
Are you going back on your words?

30:06.123 --> 30:07.643
Going back on my words?

30:07.793 --> 30:09.919
Everyone knows

30:09.943 --> 30:12.799
I'm the most reasonable man in Baiju Town.

30:12.823 --> 30:13.853
Am I right?

30:16.153 --> 30:18.393
Yes.

30:19.203 --> 30:22.523
It's just that your method is not very smart.

30:22.833 --> 30:26.719
It's against the rules.

30:26.743 --> 30:27.743
Yes.

30:29.093 --> 30:31.183
How about this, Lord Yan?

30:31.283 --> 30:32.489
let's make another bet.

30:32.513 --> 30:33.643
Still, you go first.

30:35.253 --> 30:36.973
You're sensible enough.

30:50.753 --> 30:51.953
How about this, Lord Yan?

30:52.373 --> 30:53.783
To show fairness,

30:54.283 --> 30:55.723
I want to use your dice.

31:00.593 --> 31:03.563
I also want to ask this young man beside you

31:03.663 --> 31:04.823
to shake them for me.

31:15.413 --> 31:16.833
Shake them well.

31:35.283 --> 31:36.283
Open.

31:45.273 --> 31:47.133
Three ones too?

31:52.503 --> 31:56.439
If we draw, the one who goes first wins.

31:56.463 --> 31:57.503
Take the money.

31:58.083 --> 31:59.083
Wait.

32:08.903 --> 32:10.193
Mercury.

32:12.363 --> 32:13.549
You...

32:13.573 --> 32:14.589
Boy!

32:14.613 --> 32:15.903
You tampered with them.

32:15.963 --> 32:17.919
Lord Yan, you cheated but slander me instead?

32:17.943 --> 32:18.969
Although we're in Baiju Town,

32:18.993 --> 32:20.359
we have to play fair.

32:20.383 --> 32:20.833
Yes.

32:20.853 --> 32:21.893
I quit.

32:26.523 --> 32:27.593
Catch him!

32:36.883 --> 32:38.053
Take him back.

32:38.513 --> 32:39.799
Why are you arresting me?

32:39.823 --> 32:41.283
Is there justice?

32:41.593 --> 32:42.593
Behave yourself.

32:43.193 --> 32:43.929
Let's go.

32:43.953 --> 32:45.123
Justice?

32:45.583 --> 32:47.683
I am justice.

32:47.663 --> 32:50.763
[Yan Mansion]

32:58.803 --> 33:00.093
Come here. Go.

33:21.013 --> 33:22.133
What are you looking at?

33:32.493 --> 33:33.493
Go.

33:45.263 --> 33:46.263
Come.

33:46.833 --> 33:47.833
Get in.

33:59.133 --> 34:00.213
Yan Luowang.

34:01.063 --> 34:03.269
You took my money and arrested me for hard labor.

34:03.293 --> 34:05.063
You've planned it so well.

34:12.753 --> 34:15.598
What? Do you refuse to obey?

34:15.622 --> 34:17.273
In my territory,

34:17.303 --> 34:19.093
no one can take my money

34:19.113 --> 34:21.023
and leave safely.

34:23.352 --> 34:25.173
Listen carefully.

34:25.903 --> 34:27.399
Without my order,

34:27.423 --> 34:29.183
you can't die.

34:29.622 --> 34:32.279
I'll let you rot in here

34:32.303 --> 34:34.153
little by little.

34:34.223 --> 34:35.223
Yes.
